        "node_id": "n_14_b296c2",
        "thought_text": "Since the interest rate is small (1%) and X can be up to 10^18, the number of years will be large but manageable for a simple loop in Python due to its arbitrary-precision integers, making simulation efficient enough without needing logarithmic formulas.",
